    <mdiv type="solesmes">
      <score>
        <section>
          <pb xml:id="m-3c72e1ba-7752-4915-be74-0f9b452e63bc" n="1986" facs="#m-5073998b-c4e8-45ed-b1b5-fae61412f2bf" /><div xml:id="m-389dbc0d-1e89-40c1-a2d6-4382fa0b2114">
            <lg xml:id="m-e53e978a-5fe8-4c47-951f-a199c3fc2e36">
              <l xml:id="m-0273ef86-4ae4-487b-a58f-7d7e91aeef71" facs="#m-6d23501c-ccf8-4e3b-8d37-8d0c72b5fc63" label="ambiguous">1740</l><l xml:id="m-efe73d34-c850-4e1a-8cc1-f39a2fd7ccfd" facs="#m-f06e32cc-aee0-4466-b6aa-56f8310c7008" label="ambiguous">November 2.</l><l xml:id="m-703966c9-a6e8-4dd4-a38a-8c976b49c9d7" facs="#m-5fc73a9a-cc16-48f7-9601-d09a0aefa95f" label="lyrics-like">Deduc me, Dómine, in vía túa, 1</l><l xml:id="m-b79380ac-5724-48e2-9051-d71af4bcda6a" facs="#m-6a369ff3-b0a3-4a4b-87b3-c7b016f0062c" label="ambiguous">Psalm 85.</l><l xml:id="m-5b3765e2-5b0f-4890-a769-aee6ba50fc77" facs="#m-9ec5ec5f-9892-46ee-8133-0b0faecfd7c0" label="lyrics-like">et ingrédiar in veritate túa :* lae¬</l><l xml:id="m-6ebd86e5-ef3e-479d-b191-ee6a9e694fa1" facs="#m-15af31a6-e11a-4ca4-9608-d549f29d506d" label="lyrics-like">TNclina, Dómine, aurem túam et</l><l xml:id="m-cf0190de-c7c2-4d2e-8b8e-f2e612af27cd" facs="#m-231cd527-271b-45c5-aa4c-7cc6f09eca2f" label="lyrics-like">tétur cor méum ut timeat nómen</l><l xml:id="m-58fc1832-1281-4f88-b64b-789a8a148ce6" facs="#m-1ed1f48b-9cd1-40bf-a7c4-173bf46dffc8" label="lyrics-like">túum.</l><l xml:id="m-89f2007e-7830-40d6-933d-c13e108ff8bc" facs="#m-1c5e1e92-eb4e-41ef-bfb9-d863b128eb75" label="lyrics-like">L exáudi me :* quóniam Inops et</l><l xml:id="m-48af2c6e-1286-419b-a7e9-72295d7aeb6d" facs="#m-9a7e97c9-da4f-462c-90e3-cda815806932" label="lyrics-like">Confitébor tibi. Dómine Déus</l><l xml:id="m-fb34f9fb-ad85-4514-b956-0ef7dea34893" facs="#m-4834ebaf-1c9c-4887-9d89-fb1ff3731159" label="lyrics-like">páuper sum égo.</l><l xml:id="m-7261d37d-6796-471b-a827-ab55db6151e3" facs="#m-87382c48-8c0b-429c-8dee-716ef9eda78e" label="lyrics-like">méus, in tóto córde méo, * et glori¬</l><l xml:id="m-a0dc21bc-715c-41fa-a6e2-a6e0fa142880" facs="#m-be361ae2-e139-46ab-8e4c-20d797bb1774" label="lyrics-like">Custódi ánimam méam, quóniam</l><l xml:id="m-f72a8c8b-4ef0-4a46-9010-1c639303d6e6" facs="#m-86ff1002-28d0-4b03-a2a0-521d31c1df22" label="lyrics-like">ficábo nómen túum in aetérnum:</l><l xml:id="m-cde7c187-b3e7-45c6-961e-ff4f2dc62af0" facs="#m-ef9b6243-cf9c-4a8c-a2ff-e74b720c50cf" label="lyrics-like">sánctus sum:* sálvum fac sérvum</l><l xml:id="m-7bbc5f13-8edd-45a8-aa48-a05b52523f5c" facs="#m-a6509cbe-b96a-4506-ba50-7e69aa7f8ce2" label="lyrics-like">Quia misericórdia túa mágna est</l><l xml:id="m-2332c273-7c5f-47fa-b9a1-0b42e597df6e" facs="#m-7420a19a-87ac-48f6-b8fb-939e142c7b45" label="lyrics-like">túum, Déus méus, sperántem in te.</l><l xml:id="m-12c0c84b-3b5e-4100-aaf1-05f740f64f5e" facs="#m-b01d5b42-676e-47c3-8a0c-cb815aa049c4" label="lyrics-like">súper me:“ et eruísti ánimam</l><l xml:id="m-409f5b48-4d81-4e95-a7c4-25705f05a3a9" facs="#m-43d1e244-a7c3-45ca-9532-5355843ce46f" label="lyrics-like">Miserére méi, Dómine, quóniam</l><l xml:id="m-3bf0e628-f6a9-420e-9b72-6ef818e5c75f" facs="#m-3af7e0a6-0c21-4272-857f-63be41760575" label="lyrics-like">méam ex inférno inferióri.</l><l xml:id="m-b60033f3-84c0-4c8f-9911-782a27356f74" facs="#m-46fa8fae-14ac-4b82-a0d9-bdd059a6ed31" label="lyrics-like">ad te clamávi tóta die: t laetifica</l><l xml:id="m-8f563937-d258-460b-b6ab-84974f4609e2" facs="#m-62c526dc-29e8-4e74-ad8f-98b783a0cda5" label="lyrics-like">Déus, iníqui insurrexérunt super</l><l xml:id="m-dacced33-9f84-4530-a959-8abbfe902dc1" facs="#m-87bdb61d-e56a-4b5d-b743-ab966d274ad8" label="lyrics-like">ánimam sérvi tui, * quóniam ad te,</l><l xml:id="m-e21d3981-c892-4b4d-af2f-691298619b91" facs="#m-22511224-4967-4892-a6b1-fa5e96446fe2" label="lyrics-like">me, ¡ et synagóga poténtium</l><l xml:id="m-da7cb727-1058-4fd8-a4e3-cb3477b0bdc3" facs="#m-7c553ec4-d712-4739-90a2-e5faf803fb83" label="lyrics-like">Dómine, ánimam méam levávi.</l><l xml:id="m-812fb6e5-6410-428a-8c8f-e35be5f876ab" facs="#m-047cf6bd-f50d-4b95-afc2-c85c0ad5adf7" label="lyrics-like">quaesiérunt ánimam méam: * et</l><l xml:id="m-1edea6e5-1e5d-4e03-8f01-e17fa19a444f" facs="#m-d29f9c17-b4b0-4d5e-8333-1366ff834ed6" label="lyrics-like">Quóniam tu, Dómine, suávis et</l><l xml:id="m-5024e830-0f8f-40cf-9cb8-a3f4788196b7" facs="#m-4cb2cd95-e836-4304-a0e1-7ec53fb748d0" label="lyrics-like">mitis: et múltae misericórdiae</l><l xml:id="m-f6dafee1-0d77-4750-9e04-c80c1813630e" facs="#m-0a5daf56-b70d-4df3-a843-f44f6f30ab71" label="lyrics-like">non proposuérunt te in conspéctu</l><l xml:id="m-997ae689-1a9d-456d-8b62-07d126a69806" facs="#m-8fb32794-2083-48b9-9c33-7bddf059e1a9" label="lyrics-like">ómnibus invocántibus te.</l><l xml:id="m-41e73b7b-26fc-4b61-bb4c-d04941828343" facs="#m-da887836-b383-4e95-8866-803986b6f198" label="lyrics-like">súo.</l><l xml:id="m-692749ab-918a-4431-8556-94a7fb7af367" facs="#m-bdf9e12d-1079-4126-92d3-c69ac2749c48" label="lyrics-like">Et tu, Dómine Déus, miserátor et</l><l xml:id="m-c08ef095-d5eb-4258-bb51-21936cf4613c" facs="#m-e17632a4-ba1a-463d-bd36-71604a4ac65c" label="lyrics-like">Auribus pércipe, Dómine, oratió¬</l><l xml:id="m-4e2663ba-2189-4960-9e06-4a93976b1e6f" facs="#m-6717a3bf-26e3-4c60-9db5-eec7deccaa9d" label="lyrics-like">miséricors, pátiens, et múltae</l><l xml:id="m-874f977d-895a-4117-b104-de1dd79829f6" facs="#m-798d4df7-39c8-4962-9c45-8037c41737a0" label="lyrics-like">nem méam : * et inténde vóci de¬</l><l xml:id="m-4d0a12f4-5798-4c7d-81fb-8ad76230db90" facs="#m-0b34371e-33fb-44b6-bf56-c2dd3987da6b" label="lyrics-like">precatiónis méae.</l><l xml:id="m-fbd9fcdf-a27f-4d6b-b224-96fc16a577b1" facs="#m-9fb2315c-fda5-45cd-99bc-2bff1ce5ca8d" label="lyrics-like">misericórdiae, et vérax:</l><l xml:id="m-c258e7bc-4531-4381-a6cf-8a19942acb9a" facs="#m-731f302c-90ae-41a1-a7b5-2db448545bc1" label="lyrics-like">In die tribulatiónis méae clamávi</l><l xml:id="m-172120c4-aba9-48a1-a965-87f778658898" facs="#m-bf389344-73f4-4d8b-bb0f-0d416cc1699b" label="lyrics-like">Réspice in me et miserére méi, f</l><l xml:id="m-6a4736ef-e9de-482c-8eda-7dde1c4cff44" facs="#m-aca99508-9f33-4fa5-b6bb-fc7cea6f6763" label="lyrics-like">da impérium túum puero túo:* et</l><l xml:id="m-2d6fe122-e5a4-4ef7-a498-a52cecf7a48a" facs="#m-d9d6750d-5d87-43f3-ba98-09178b25de8c" label="lyrics-like">âd te:* quia exaudisti me.</l><l xml:id="m-c9f54c22-30be-4c25-a8f0-cebf19b31907" facs="#m-cd8373a0-b657-4171-b65a-9fe4e5e2208b" label="lyrics-like">sálvum fac filium ancillae túae.</l><l xml:id="m-94516804-f747-40d2-a469-8ee5c7827904" facs="#m-121786aa-d27c-473a-872e-1bf207287b58" label="lyrics-like">Non est similis tui in diis, Dó¬</l><l xml:id="m-362c4e63-b2e9-4d78-9da4-f5ee47056329" facs="#m-47e78744-53e3-4456-a5ff-44e985440ba5" label="lyrics-like">Fac mécum signum in bónum, t</l><l xml:id="m-66d0e1a9-4e14-44ba-8266-dc35738a7560" facs="#m-79c09fa8-b411-4bb2-8dbb-5c324adcea9f" label="lyrics-like">mine : * et non est secúndum ópe¬</l><l xml:id="m-1407b7d4-e600-4568-ab56-851fb5e571e9" facs="#m-018f34cf-3964-493c-969a-f75eea5909cd" label="lyrics-like">ut videant qui odérunt me, et</l><l xml:id="m-03d2c238-ecfa-41b7-b210-cedaaeaa145c" facs="#m-da7af348-a524-42bf-9e5f-0febdc9d7616" label="lyrics-like">ra túa.</l><l xml:id="m-649bc6f7-9344-4bdf-ad73-edec37c3cada" facs="#m-536c395c-9209-4d2c-9997-18868d25c53f" label="lyrics-like">confundántur:* quóniam tu, Dó¬</l><l xml:id="m-af45d87d-2230-4193-9c71-d013a85a0153" facs="#m-50396362-5cd2-4e91-b416-02f428d8a139" label="lyrics-like">Omnes géntes quascúmque fecísti</l><l xml:id="m-3bbb20fa-c374-4724-96cf-4ffd6ed57fc9" facs="#m-d7b69f57-804f-4f2f-bb88-eaa75aa84c79" label="lyrics-like">mine, adjuvísti me et consolátus es</l><l xml:id="m-781d73b0-380a-4dff-b87d-c63494538658" facs="#m-9ce69105-e94c-4037-a51a-8a42d17e9af2" label="lyrics-like">vénient, et adorábunt coram te,</l><l xml:id="m-9da5cdb8-5860-4a79-ad0b-d81763cbb581" facs="#m-69ba739a-0436-4783-bd22-3b9cad1bd672" label="lyrics-like">Dóminé :* et glorificábunt nómen</l><l xml:id="m-a05550d1-c463-40fd-ac5d-e77c0efe7f73" facs="#m-185e8a9c-fc5f-45e4-96ea-f9032c060b67" label="ambiguous">me.</l><l xml:id="m-12195084-97d4-42b0-a622-850354ddf26b" facs="#m-56b3cdf2-14f5-43ad-aed3-d849062ff02c" label="lyrics-like">Réquiem aetérnam* dóna éis,</l><l xml:id="m-8a2eaf79-f5c6-420c-b496-1662d584d1a7" facs="#m-5bb96cb4-9164-4188-9981-fe889dad0b24" label="lyrics-like">túum.</l><l xml:id="m-52a231ef-835f-4927-bd2d-3e6dd3fb91c2" facs="#m-32e1c006-c289-48ec-801b-7a80f6d91969" label="lyrics-like">Quóniam mágnus es tu et fáciens Dómine.</l><l xml:id="m-2573f795-25f8-4cb0-8f81-f2a098973e62" facs="#m-716411ec-d3fc-4da9-80bc-cced77548b9b" label="lyrics-like">Et lux perpétua“ lúceat eis.</l><l xml:id="m-6cf22b8f-9471-4797-ae50-b0b7bc510a6f" facs="#m-05ab8efc-fed0-4a71-85d6-f200248c89d6" label="lyrics-like">mirabilia: * tu es Déus sólus.</l><l xml:id="m-2ea30e7f-5a44-46b7-80de-2f650c59e643" facs="#m-d5fe2d03-55e7-4583-9541-395e1b4995b8" label="text-like">AT NONE.</l><l xml:id="m-c35b21fb-200d-4a6e-a50e-d630011bfd84" facs="#m-ac1a1c81-9fa1-4c71-8d67-e11e456d5439" label="ambiguous">"7</l><l xml:id="m-3a966a1b-7680-4201-b450-aa8a9323d66c" facs="#m-1aaa333f-0106-4a04-980a-2257fde2ca2a" label="ambiguous">corax in domicilio.</l><l xml:id="m-ef500043-64f5-424d-84bd-7ba69fbac4a2" facs="#m-cc467e7c-15b4-473d-9dad-b0a8f60fc993" label="ambiguous">Psalm I01. 1.</l><l xml:id="m-8431742f-6ebc-4199-89ab-b996bb827355" facs="#m-9fccf698-6617-4559-bc44-30bf84110570" label="lyrics-like">Vigilavi, * et fáctus sum sicut</l><l xml:id="m-14ca1096-140d-4538-a618-c7cf90a1421a" facs="#m-826ee6a7-aaf6-46e2-91ef-2dee0b26b411" label="lyrics-like">Omine, exáudi oratiónem</l><l xml:id="m-36ce7b0d-b738-4b14-9d7f-a49a51887bf8" facs="#m-89eef2e1-6406-43a1-9034-28431f437e26" label="lyrics-like">pásser solitárius in técto.</l><l xml:id="m-f9980d00-eb10-462f-adb0-80f4226b6054" facs="#m-24b193ad-8b58-423d-bc70-0ae8a292aee1" label="lyrics-like">méam: *et clámor méus ad</l><l xml:id="m-fe743076-056b-4ceb-8a91-fc98bc822ac0" facs="#m-5b4fc7a5-72b5-45ac-a441-d0c1e9536c4c" label="lyrics-like">Tóta díe exprobrábant mihi ini¬</l><l xml:id="m-6b675cf2-5375-453c-834a-03e080a0eaae" facs="#m-d4b7b76e-5d1c-4c74-aaaa-ffe609813318" label="lyrics-like">mici mei:“et qui laudábant me,</l><l xml:id="m-3252475b-2559-4f81-932d-9b70150e962c" facs="#m-d59697a4-5d65-420d-823f-1a9ba6ef0215" label="lyrics-like">te véniat.</l><l xml:id="m-94028323-1779-4716-9a57-b2110bfe2744" facs="#m-1c41306c-0ed5-422a-930e-9a6c7b17d8d9" label="lyrics-like">Non avértas fáciem túam á me:"</l><l xml:id="m-c0bccf59-d64c-4a14-9437-4bc156b13669" facs="#m-4cb3398c-c800-4ead-a9b4-77072c705c79" label="lyrics-like">advérsum me jurábant.</l><l xml:id="m-a75c7e24-ac00-401f-8e96-f81a91f83bb4" facs="#m-52546698-30af-487d-99b3-6ee61174ae74" label="lyrics-like">Quia cínerem tamquam pánem</l><l xml:id="m-2b49c732-3608-4c58-a882-9288db174bb9" facs="#m-a25994de-c029-435a-975b-f9603b559f11" label="lyrics-like">in quacúmque die tribulor, inclina</l><l xml:id="m-c248dba5-eb05-4baf-85f3-f429c0e0e6a3" facs="#m-44515fdb-bf33-4313-984f-6ca914248bcc" label="lyrics-like">mandueabam, * et pótum méum</l><l xml:id="m-a50eed3b-53c1-48cb-99be-1c338f9485ea" facs="#m-37e8460e-5237-40db-8daa-c056209cc3e7" label="lyrics-like">ad me áurem túam.</l><l xml:id="m-4487665b-96a7-4904-a06a-9a6040e878da" facs="#m-7de1bed0-6cbc-4b47-99a7-2d90dcae3aa5" label="lyrics-like">In quacúmque die invocávero</l><l xml:id="m-b762243d-4af2-4215-8af1-521bab3ebe9e" facs="#m-5e24a919-c0ff-4e63-aa7f-e090d060802e" label="lyrics-like">cum flétu miscébam.</l><l xml:id="m-d6b9ca09-6f49-42f5-8671-71f995de398a" facs="#m-7ea2bf79-b256-40b8-88cf-576f2f445fb6" label="lyrics-like">A fácie frae et indignatiónis</l><l xml:id="m-86499ab3-f4b8-48ba-bd03-9e331991162c" facs="#m-db5fd923-be65-42f5-a0aa-40107919b539" label="lyrics-like">te, * vélóciter exáudi me.</l><l xml:id="m-63745b9c-f1a0-449c-bae7-32aecb1fb133" facs="#m-3b169f87-5fbe-4b32-907a-6752874dc210" label="lyrics-like">túae:* quia élevans allisisti me.</l><l xml:id="m-862414fc-26b6-4889-bac1-62690257c032" facs="#m-e83b3ca6-8ee3-4311-921d-2a2e1718ebb4" label="lyrics-like">Quia defecérunt sicut fúmus díes</l><l xml:id="m-58154502-75a9-46b7-9053-c805269801f0" facs="#m-eb73b32a-f83f-444f-bf01-6f7f9321ea80" label="lyrics-like">Dies méi sicut úmbra declina¬</l><l xml:id="m-4843637d-3c14-4327-ad05-40490729b38c" facs="#m-dae893b7-74a4-46d7-9d7c-c3ab508ef331" label="lyrics-like">mel :* et óssa méa sicut crémium</l><l xml:id="m-ac897396-895a-40dd-9e3b-126b6451c499" facs="#m-964e48e6-1abd-46c2-9de5-c3710e70287d" label="lyrics-like">aruérunt.</l><l xml:id="m-a9ee8b9c-7827-4c75-b532-91c5ebaffbf0" facs="#m-23ef9a0f-e0f6-4918-8ffe-47d45f151116" label="lyrics-like">vérunt: * et égo sicut foénum</l><l xml:id="m-ecc076ad-db7a-4ea8-8b05-9dcf2d431444" facs="#m-bed6b861-4aba-4f94-add0-43a78e0d5813" label="lyrics-like">Percússus sum ut foénum, et áruit</l><l xml:id="m-750f1b68-fc37-405e-b090-448e8e168d1d" facs="#m-220f9bda-464f-432a-9e9e-cf653393bfeb" label="lyrics-like">árui.</l><l xml:id="m-d1cf26a1-b9d5-4a2d-a20a-5c3d40312d74" facs="#m-796fb572-190d-4f22-80eb-62602fd7d6f0" label="lyrics-like">Tu autem, Dómine, in aetérnum</l><l xml:id="m-312e83a6-d76e-4134-b2ed-e2694524853c" facs="#m-2ed70d44-a20b-4d8f-9457-9619f4d7beda" label="lyrics-like">cor méum:* quia oblítus sum co¬</l><l xml:id="m-fae479a8-ef96-4494-93c3-ff18e0ab4b0e" facs="#m-1fa75866-be79-4b2c-8f55-583ab185be07" label="lyrics-like">médere pánem méum.</l><l xml:id="m-a27b8906-93ef-4e45-bded-687af8ae302d" facs="#m-45d2d97b-b555-499e-b10d-eaab190dcd1f" label="lyrics-like">pérmanes :* et memoriále túum in</l><l xml:id="m-7a30a5eb-43a1-4bab-b20f-b0232f46f050" facs="#m-7e6b2158-f4b7-44e5-bc22-d95e01b0ce3b" label="lyrics-like">A vóce gémitus méi * adhaésit</l><l xml:id="m-b3b1248f-9cc1-4d27-87dc-85e722d1e294" facs="#m-dc861fb5-3612-40c8-b2ce-9dd790bc7f60" label="lyrics-like">generatiónem et generatiónem.</l><l xml:id="m-7bd15c9d-a85a-4e90-a67e-135031be714b" facs="#m-cbdd84a2-7c16-42a1-a8fe-6fd73614724c" label="lyrics-like">Réquiem actérnam“dóna éis,</l><l xml:id="m-a78f6e28-c157-4cde-9cf3-5a90f301b69f" facs="#m-e47a2ee9-dbdb-42f2-8512-da6b1b6f8e17" label="lyrics-like">os méum cárni méae.</l><l xml:id="m-fb3b8b0f-ed44-48cc-9a58-0be0d986d451" facs="#m-a46cd7c7-ba44-46c0-b2e3-eb417eefd086" label="lyrics-like">Similis fáctus sum pellicáno soli¬</l><l xml:id="m-eff72dd5-daa1-471e-9fd3-5b1546ace97f" facs="#m-b6dfdc3e-1794-46bf-967b-6ae25f99e0f0" label="lyrics-like">Dómine.</l><l xml:id="m-d58a9fc4-c638-4bbd-a0d1-35d4a0e1430a" facs="#m-e366a263-f5d4-46c9-bc6c-2e21b3e25e86" label="lyrics-like">túdinis :* fáctus sum sicut nycti¬</l><l xml:id="m-5cc1046a-af17-4e96-9c8e-f41dccbe199a" facs="#m-d7d871e3-ccd2-4ab3-9515-c23c57f77044" label="lyrics-like">Et lux perpétua * lúceat éis.</l></lg></div></section></score></mdiv></body></music>
</mei>